            "title": "Question 5",
            "id": 76103,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Kodu çalıştırdığımızda konsolda ne görüntülenir?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"average_grade = \" /><text value=\"&quot;B&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"average_grade = \" /><text value=\"&quot;A-&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"subject = \" /><text value=\"&quot;Programming&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(average_grade)\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"A-\" /></content></output></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>A-</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>Programming</code></item><item value=\"4\" correct=\"false\"><code>B</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>A-</code> öğesini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p><code>average_grade</code> değişkenine iki kez değer atanıyor. <code>print(average_grade)</code> hangi değeri kullanır?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"average_grade = \" /><text value=\"&quot;B&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"average_grade = \" /><text value=\"&quot;A-&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"subject = \" /><text value=\"&quot;Programming&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(average_grade)\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"A-\" /></content></output></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">En son atanan değer olan <code>A-</code> değerini.</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">İlk atanan değer olan <code>B</code> değerini.</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>subject</code> değişkenindeki <code>Programming</code> değerini.</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">En son atanan değer olan <code>A-</code> değerini.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Example 2",
            "id": 76087,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Tekrar dene, hata buydu: Dosyanın sonuna beklenmedik şekilde ulaşıldı. Şu öğeler kapatılmadı: p. 1. satır, 53. konum.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"average_rating = \" /><text value=\"25\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"average_rating = \" /><text value=\"5\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(average_rating)\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"20\" endIndex=\"34\" /><option startIndex=\"35\" endIndex=\"36\" /><option startIndex=\"37\" endIndex=\"38\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"rating\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"5\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Önce <code>average_rating</code>, ardından <code>=</code> ve son olarak <code>5</code> öğelerini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>İlk değeri yerine konsolda <code>5</code> yazdırılması için <code>average_rating</code> değişkenini değiştir.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"average_rating = \" /><text value=\"25\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"average_rating = \" /><text value=\"5\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(average_rating)\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"20\" endIndex=\"34\" /><option startIndex=\"35\" endIndex=\"36\" /><option startIndex=\"37\" endIndex=\"38\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"==\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"25\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"5\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Önce <code>average_rating</code>, ardından <code>=</code> ve son olarak <code>5</code> öğelerini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>",
