            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Hangi satır <code>not</code> kullanarak <code>is_monday</code> değişkenine özel <code>False</code> değerini verir?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>is_monday = not True</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>is_monday = True</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>is_monday = \"not True\"</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>is_monday = not True</code> öğesini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>",
